              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("From far in the distance comes the sound of branches snapping, followed by a long, hollow boom. The world goes silent for a moment."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Can you feel it? It is as if the entire forest is stunned! Something has happened and, I fear, not for the good."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Muff%20Argulak%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("A hollow screech echoes throughout the caverns. The air suddenly seems fresher and lighter."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_16",
        on: "branch_if_16",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            equals: "Haralamdum",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Greetings, Sir Wose. We seek the exit to these caverns."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Haralamdum",
            text: _("If ... hmm dum ... you could help rid us of these ... alam hurum ... infernal undead, I would be ... alam alam ... look to the north and east ... hmm ... most grateful. Har alam dum."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_17",
        on: "branch_if_17",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "unit.id",
            not_equals: "Haralamdum",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Well met, stranger."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Well met, indeed. We seek the exit to these caverns."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Then you should look to the north and east. But, if you would, might we ask your assistance?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("What aid might we offer?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("If you would help rid these caverns of those infernal undead, the Ancient One would be most grateful."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ancient one?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Our elder. Called, by some, Haralamdum."),
          },
        ],
      },
